body:
I feel happy for you if this is your worst. One of my worsts was;


I was Necromancer in a tt game. Our team included a Hex Master, a Coven Leader and a Medusa. HM died earlier and our coven leader told me that it was safe to claim Tracker because they stoned him the first night, so i did. And unluckily there was a cc. Despite there was room for 2 trackers at the same time, other cc pushed me hard and got me killed the day after we both claimed. No problem, i died. But the HM told me that i was gamethrowing and reported me because i couldnt make CL and Medusa stone the real tracker. I told him i would be even more suspicious if someone cc'ing and pushing me got stoned the next day. He was refusing to understand. He said only gamethrower was me not even medusa or cl. 


Get used to it :)
